                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "txt_features": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<ul><li><strong>Bio-Motion Placement</strong><br/>Clips to ankles, wrists, or arms, where moving joints create the fastest driver recognition.</li><li><strong>Three Light Modes</strong><br/>Solid, quick flash, or slow flash. Choose based on conditions and preference.</li><li><strong>180° Red LED Coverage</strong><br/>Three LEDs spread light across a wide arc so you are visible from any angle behind or beside you.</li><li><strong>Ultra-Lightweight</strong><br/>Weighs just half an ounce. No bouncing, no awareness of it on the wrist or ankle.</li><li><strong>Water-Resistant</strong><br/>Built for outdoor use in rain and varied weather conditions.</li><li><strong>Batteries Included</strong><br/>CR2032 cells installed and a full spare set in the box. Small screwdriver included for changes.</li><li><strong>Set of Two</strong><br/>Cover front and rear simultaneously, or share one with a running partner.</li></ul>",
                        "width": "100%",
